		{"id":"05d7e068d561881a","type":"text","text":"1. Why us\n\t- Well received \n\t- Affordable\n\t- Quality ingredients\n\t- User-friendly experience\n2. Product showcase \n\t- Show the food with small descriptions\n3. Review\n\t- Fake some reviews\n4. Map (needs work)\n\t- Shows the map of Malaysia\n\t- Some regions are clickable","x":99,"y":405,"width":540,"height":500,"color":"#228b22"},
		{"id":"d2379f3f9d8d6039","type":"text","text":"If the map method is implemented, the food showcased is each region's specialty.\ne.g. \n1. Penang \n\t- Hokkien Mee\n\t- Laksa","x":751,"y":160,"width":400,"height":340,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"04ee66222af29dbf","type":"text","text":"Needs to decide how we're going to categorise the food.\n*Are we going by state or food type?*","x":751,"y":-40,"width":443,"height":145,"color":"1"},
