		{"id":"9c6d098e66c78f73","type":"text","text":"We focus on only showcasing the food in Malaysia.\nEach food would have their descriptions and recipe\nIn a sense, this is the easiest route","x":-2046,"y":2832,"width":332,"height":300,"color":"#228b22"},
