		{"id":"8c1899926d1d5ab3","type":"text","text":"We focus on showcasing the food in Malaysia and sending the ingredients to the customer.\n\nEach food would have their descriptions and recipe\n\nAn additional function - purchase meal - will be added. \n\nThis route is **marketing route** but leaned into e-commerce","x":-1310,"y":2792,"width":416,"height":460,"color":"#228b22"},
		{"id":"d106c852d4d63af2","type":"text","text":"It's basically food panda or grab food.\n\nOur website would be like a web app.\n\nWe will showcase Malaysian food and offers cooked food. ","x":-660,"y":2812,"width":416,"height":285,"color":"#228b22"},
